# A new game: the name, the intro text and movie, the first scene.
# Areas are of the 1280x960 Xephyr screen dosrun's DOSBox draws in.

# the Quit button: the fire plays on New game
wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
key Return
# Type your name:
wait name 400x56+440+152 60
key a b c
sleep 1
shot typed
key Return
# the introduction's text: the corner it leaves to the planet
wait text 400x200+700+620 60
sleep 1
shot intro
key Escape
sleep 8
shot movie
key Escape
# the lamps above the cell
wait scene 280x200+300+124 240
down Up
sleep 1
up Up
sleep 1
shot walked
